  "worked_solution": "We are told that: \n\nEvery second,  Mary travels $4$ meters  while Tina  travels $3$ meters \n\nSo, in a tape diagram, Mary's tape must contain $4$ boxes, while the tape corresponding to Tina should have $3$ boxes.\n\nTherefore, the diagram is the following:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14187307/assets/23498cdbf112703b7ca7cf6bce275a83b0ad8f7a63df73007dcd5f010bb3c69d.png)",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
